    "title": "Clean Energy Policy Lever Identification",
    "content": "Investigate US, EU, and UK clean energy policy landscapes to identify specific legislative levers and subsidy adjustments politically feasible for a mid-sized renewable energy developer. Research current IRA implementation status, manufacturing incentives, tariff structures, and political dynamics to produce actionable intelligence for 2025-2026 immediate opportunities and 2028-2030 strategic planning.",
