            "goal": "Research EU and UK clean energy industrial policy approaches: European Green Deal Industrial Plan implementation, Net-Zero Industry Act manufacturing subsidies, EU battery regulation incentives, UK Green Industrial Strategy funding mechanisms. Focus on import tariff structures, local content requirements, and manufacturing subsidies that could inform US advocacy strategies or competitive positioning.",
