            "goal": "Assess current US political feasibility landscape for clean energy policy adjustments: analyze 119th Congress committee structures, recent legislative signals on energy manufacturing, state-level policy opportunities (particularly in states with manufacturing incentives), and regulatory shifts at DOE, Treasury, and Commerce. Identify bipartisan or administratively actionable levers requiring minimal congressional action.",
